# Keep the Docker build context small and avoid copying Windows build output into Linux images.
**/bin/
**/obj/
.git/
.vs/
.idea/
**/*.user
tests/
docs/
scripts/
*.md
# The Angular app is built with Node, not .NET; keep it (and its 250 MB node_modules) out of the .NET builds.
src/Web/
**/node_modules/
